Name: keepa-rival-fixture
Version: 0.2.0
Summary: Synthetic provider distribution that claims the keepa-fixture provider id.
Author: EvidenceWiki contributors
License: MIT
Requires-Python: >=3.10

Exists to prove the duplicate-id rule: two installed distributions claiming one provider
id invalidate both registrations rather than resolving by installation order.
